Inside Cage
This barred rectangular hovel is blanketed with straw and has the look, if not the smell, of a human dwelling. Its southside door stands open.

In contrast with the seedy surroundings, an expensive-looking pair of headphones lies on the straw.

There's a bucket here.

Inside the bucket you see a corpuscular lump of meat.

