Standing Room Only
All around you the crowd is in a state of pandemonium. The paths of least resistance are down and west.

The bank of people above you shouts, in chorus, "Move it!"

A hawker appears at the east end of your row, calling out in a sing-song manner, "Get your tofu here. Get your Old Coke here."

>down
