Standing Room Only
All around you the crowd is in a state of pandemonium. The paths of least resistance are up, down and west.

>west
The row of legs pivots away as you scissor awkwardly past.

Standing Room Only
All around you the crowd is in a state of pandemonium. The paths of least resistance are down and east.

A man in the audience suddenly hails you, tossing the one-dollar-and-85-cent granola bar in your direction. It glances off your head, falls through the stands and right before it hits the ground, in a cold sweat you wake up ....

Hypnotist's Parlor, on the leather sofa
The parlor, with its tufted black leather sofa, softly lighted chandelier and darkly varnished paneling strives for a subdued turn-of-the-century motif and is purposefully dimmed -- thus setting the mood for conveyance, for squinting.

Standing here, attired in an immaculate black tuxedo, is none other than Rimshaw himself.

