He reads the ransom note, silently mouthing the words. 

"So you think you've fingered me for this note. Pretty thin stuff, if you ask me. Besides, I've got no gripes against the bossman. Why, here I am doing cherry pie in the middle of the night." Chuckles does a slow burn as he continues cleaning the trailer.

Chuckles dribbles a little Dr. Nostrum's onto his rag and continues wiping away at the trailer.

