As you approach the white wagon, Mr. Munrab steps down from inside his office and, as his eyes fall upon the figure of you carrying the only bit of preciousness in his life, it's as if he were jolted by an elephant prod. For an instant, his confused mind appears to be sending him strong fight-or-flight messages, for suddenly he dashes off through the hole in the fence.

